"""Level 4 (ages 9-11), November batch: 30 puzzles.  Factors and multiples, 5-digit numbers, order of operations, mixed numbers, decimals,
angle turns, symmetry, area and perimeter, data.  Every puzzle names its maths sub-structure (sub=...) from taxonomy.json.
Nothing above the Ages 9-11 page list: no mean, median or mode (statistics at this level is tables and line graphs), no hexagon or triangle
angle sums, no ratio, no percentage."""
